WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:03.444
CONGRESSIONAL CORRESPONDENT

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:05.046
MIKE EMANUEL ON ANNOUNCEMENT

00:00:03.578 --> 00:00:05.980
MOST PEOPLE DID NOT SEE COMING,

00:00:05.179 --> 00:00:07.882
AT LEAST NOT TODAY.

00:00:06.114 --> 00:00:09.150
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING TO YOU.

00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:11.686
THE DEMANDS OF BEING HOUSE

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:12.687
SPEAKER HUGE IN TERMS OF

00:00:11.819 --> 00:00:13.021
FUND-RAISING, TRAVEL, OVERALL

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.723
STRESS.

00:00:13.154 --> 00:00:16.658
&gt;&gt; PAUL RYAN SAYS HE'S HAD

00:00:15.857 --> 00:00:17.792
ENOUGH.

00:00:16.791 --> 00:00:19.894
&gt;&gt; MUCH WORK REMAINS.

00:00:17.925 --> 00:00:21.362
I LIKE TO THINK I HAVE DONE MY

00:00:20.028 --> 00:00:23.431
PART, MY LITTLE PART IN HISTORY

00:00:21.496 --> 00:00:25.833
TO SET US ON A BETTER COURSE.

00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:26.968
&gt;&gt; A SOURCE SAYS RYAN MADE THE

00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:29.437
FINAL DECISION WITH HIS WIFE

00:00:27.101 --> 00:00:30.071
OVER EASTER RECESS AND THAT AS

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.639
RECENTLY AS FEBRUARY RYAN

00:00:30.204 --> 00:00:31.939
CONSIDERED RUNNING FOR ANOTHER

00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:32.974
TERM.

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:34.609
SPEAKER TOLD HIS STAFF EARLY

00:00:33.107 --> 00:00:38.246
THIS MORNING AND RECEIVED A

00:00:34.742 --> 00:00:39.247
STANDING OVATION FROM HIS TEAM.

00:00:38.379 --> 00:00:40.782
RYAN TOLD HIS REPUBLICAN

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.649
COLLEAGUES AND REPORTERS, FAMILY

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:43.918
WAS A KEY CONSIDERATION.

00:00:41.783 --> 00:00:48.022
&gt;&gt; WHAT I REALIZES IF I'M HERE

00:00:44.052 --> 00:00:48.923
FOR ONE MORE TERM, MY KIDS WILL

00:00:48.156 --> 00:00:51.959
ONLY HAVE EVER KNOWN ME AS A

00:00:49.057 --> 00:00:53.628
WEEKEND DAD.

00:00:52.093 --> 00:00:55.430
I JUST CAN'T LET THAT HAPPEN.

00:00:53.761 --> 00:00:58.266
&gt;&gt; RYAN ALSO SPOKE BY PHONE THIS

00:00:55.563 --> 00:00:59.600
MORNING WITH HIS HOUSE G.O.P.

00:00:58.399 --> 00:01:01.636
LEADERSHIP TEAM, VICE PRESIDENT

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:03.237
PENCE, AND PRESIDENT TRUMP.

00:01:01.769 --> 00:01:04.672
THE PRESIDENT SALUTED RYAN'S

00:01:03.371 --> 00:01:05.940
SERVICE ON TWITTER, CALLING HIM

00:01:04.806 --> 00:01:07.442
A TRULY GOOD MAN WHO WILL LEAVE

00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:07.842
AN UNQUESTIONABLE LEGACY OF

00:01:07.575 --> 00:01:09.644
ACHIEVEMENT.

00:01:07.975 --> 00:01:11.245
AMONG THE CHALLENGES FOR RYAN, A

00:01:09.777 --> 00:01:12.680
VOCAL BLOCK OF HOUSE

00:01:11.379 --> 00:01:13.081
CONSERVATIVES WHO CHALLENGED HIS

00:01:12.814 --> 00:01:13.915
LEADERSHIP.

00:01:13.214 --> 00:01:16.684
IN NEGOTIATING PARTNER IN THE

00:01:14.182 --> 00:01:17.251
PRESIDENT WHO AT TIMES COULD BE

00:01:16.818 --> 00:01:18.653
UNPREDICTABLE.

00:01:17.385 --> 00:01:21.489
THE PRESIDENT THREATENED TO VETO

00:01:18.786 --> 00:01:22.290
A $1.320 PENDING BAGGAGE THAT HE

00:01:21.622 --> 00:01:23.291
ONCE EMBRACED.

00:01:22.423 --> 00:01:23.925
ANOTHER FRUSTRATION WAS

00:01:23.424 --> 00:01:27.028
CAMPAIGNING FOR YEARS ON

00:01:24.058 --> 00:01:28.663
REPEALING AND REPLACING

00:01:27.161 --> 00:01:29.864
OBAMACARE AND THE SENATE COMING

00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:30.631
UP SHORT.

00:01:29.997 --> 00:01:32.467
THE SENATE MAJORITY LEADER NOTED

00:01:30.765 --> 00:01:33.067
THAT RYAN DIDN'T ASPIRE TO BE

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:35.069
SPEAKER.

00:01:33.201 --> 00:01:36.671
&gt;&gt; LIKE A TRUE LEADER, PAUL

00:01:35.203 --> 00:01:38.573
STEPPED UP TO THE PLATE.

00:01:36.804 --> 00:01:39.841
HE ANSWERED HIS COLLEAGUES' CALL

00:01:38.706 --> 00:01:43.111
WITH THE EARNEST, SELFLESS, AND

00:01:39.974 --> 00:01:45.446
FOCUSED APPROACHED THAT HAS

00:01:43.244 --> 00:01:45.847
DEFINED HIS ENTIRE CAREER IN

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.148
CONGRESS.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:48.850
&gt;&gt; TOP DEMOCRATS SANG HIS

00:01:47.281 --> 00:01:50.752
PRAISES TOO.

00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:52.954
&gt;&gt; SPEAKER RYAN IS A GOOD MAN.

00:01:50.885 --> 00:01:56.057
HE'S ALWAYS TRUE TO HIS WORD,

00:01:53.087 --> 00:01:57.291
EVEN THOUGH WE DISAGREED ON MOST

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:59.827
ISSUES, IN THE AREAS WHERE WE

00:01:57.425 --> 00:02:01.662
COULD WORK TOGETHER, I FOUND HIM

00:01:59.961 --> 00:02:02.130
TO BE SMART, THOUGHTFUL, AND

00:02:01.796 --> 00:02:02.930
STRAIGHTFORWARD.

00:02:02.263 --> 00:02:05.900
I FOUND HIM TO HAVE A GREAT DEAL

00:02:03.064 --> 00:02:06.934
OF INTEGRITY.

00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:08.803
&gt;&gt; MAJOR HIGHLIGHT FOR THE

00:02:07.068 --> 00:02:11.472
POLICY WALK WAS THE FIRST TAX

00:02:08.936 --> 00:02:12.206
REFORM IN MORE THAN 30 YEARS,

00:02:11.606 --> 00:02:12.607
AND HIS COLLEAGUES SAY THERE IS

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:16.110
STILL TIME.

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:16.711
&gt;&gt; I THINK PAUL IS WHEN TO BE

00:02:16.244 --> 00:02:19.046
ANYTHING BUT LAME DUCK.

00:02:16.844 --> 00:02:22.083
I THINK WE ARE GOING TO BE ABLE

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:22.450
TO GET MORE THINGS DONE WHILE

00:02:22.216 --> 00:02:25.253
HE'S HERE.

00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:26.053
&gt;&gt; IN TERMS OF WHAT'S NEXT FOR

